When working with electronic invoicing / `@happy-prod/facturador`:

1. Prefer the Facturador MCP tools if available (`facturador_overview`, `facturador_payload_requirements`, `facturador_validate_payload`).
2. Read project docs under `docs/facturador/` (especially `KNOWLEDGE.md` and `INTEGRATION_GUIDE.md`).
3. Call the library only from server-side code. Never send P12/PIN/Hacienda passwords from the browser.
4. Set `config.project_name` for usage telemetry.
5. Payload shape matches the integration guide (`config`, `tipo_documento`, `lineas`, etc.).
